nities, and strong potential for capital appreciation, it presents an attractive opportunity for both homeowners and investors.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Soma Residences a good investment?"},{"id":10477,"answer":"<p>The project offers a 50/50 payment plan, including a 20% down payment, three instalments of 10% each during construction, and the remaining 50% upon handover.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan for Soma Residences?"},{"id":10478,"answer":"<p>Soma Residences apartments include 1, 2, and 3-bedroom units, along with spacious 3-bedroom duplexes.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What apartment types are available at Soma Residences?"},{"id":10479,"answer":"<p>Residents enjoy a 20m infinity pool, children's pool, clubhouse, clubhouse café with co-working space, Technogym fitness centre, movement studio, treatment room, sauna and steam rooms, rooftop lounge, rooftop padel court, and a sunken lounge.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities does Soma Residences offer?"},{"id":10480,"answer":"<p>The expected handover for the development is scheduled for 2028.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"When is Soma Residences handover?"},{"id":10481,"answer":"<p>Yes, Soma Residences by Origami Development offers freehold ownership, allowing eligible local and international buyers to own property in the development.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Soma Residences freehold?"},{"id":10482,"answer":"<p>You can explore our latest Soma Residences Dubai Islands for sale listings through Zoya Ventures Real Estate. Our property specialists can guide you through available units, pricing, and the complete purchase process.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"How can I invest in Soma Residences?"},{"id":10483,"answer":"<p>Soma Residences by Origami Developer combines boutique living, contemporary design by XBD Collective, wellness-focused features, premium amenities, and a sought-after waterfront location, making it an excellent choice for modern island living.</p>","question":"Why choo